// A handle's glue is compiled against its package's headers, so a package declaring one names
// them.
// error: the C handle `Object` has no header to be compiled against: name the one that declares `fx_object *` in a `headers` list of the `c-libraries` of package `c-handle-no-header`

@c(type: "fx_object *", release: "fx_object_unref")
class Object

main() = 0
